		<dt>Paid on certain employee tips, <a class="indexterm" href="#en_US_2025_publink1000313321">Credit for employer social security and Medicare taxes paid on certain employee tips (Form 8846).</a></dt>
		<dt>Personal property, <a class="indexterm" href="#en_US_2025_publink1000313559">Personal property tax.</a></dt>
		<dt>Real estate, <a class="indexterm" href="#en_US_2025_publink1000313561">Real estate taxes.</a></dt>
		<dt>Sales, <a class="indexterm" href="#en_US_2025_publink1000313562">Sales tax.</a></dt>
		<dt>Self-employment, <a class="indexterm" href="#en_US_2025_publink1000313194">Self-Employment (SE) Tax</a>, <a class="indexterm" href="#en_US_2025_publink1000313558">SE tax.</a></dt>
	</dl>
	</dd>
	<dt id="ientry-id280">Third parties, Payments to, <a class="indexterm" href="#en_US_2025_publink1000313365">Payments to third parties.</a></dt>
	<dt id="ientry-id443">Tolls, <a class="indexterm" href="#en_US_2025_publink1000313515">Parking fees and tolls.</a></dt>
	<dt id="ientry-id375">Trade discount, <a class="indexterm" href="#en_US_2025_publink1000313440">Trade discounts.</a>, <a class="indexterm" href="#en_US_2025_publink1000313458">Trade discounts.</a></dt>
	<dt id="ientry-id5">Trade or business, <a class="indexterm" href="#en_US_2025_publink100033111">Are You Self-Employed?</a></dt>
	<dt id="ientry-id275">Trailer park owner, <a class="indexterm" href="#en_US_2025_publink1000313360">Trailer park owner.</a></dt>
	<dt id="ientry-id432">Transportation expenses, <a class="indexterm" href="#en_US_2025_publink1000313504">Local transportation expenses.</a></dt>
	<dt id="ientry-id514">Travel expenses, <a class="indexterm" href="#en_US_2025_publink1000313568">Travel expenses.</a></dt>
</dl>
</div>

<div class="indexdiv">
<h3>U</h3>

<dl>
	<dt id="ientry-id75">Underpayment of tax penalty, <a class="indexterm" href="#en_US_2025_publink1000313193">Penalty for underpayment of tax.</a></dt>
	<dt id="ientry-id146">Uniform capitalization rules, <a class="indexterm" href="#en_US_2025_publink1000313280">Uniform Capitalization Rules</a></dt>
</dl>
</div>

<div class="indexdiv">
<h3>W</h3>

<dl>
	<dt id="ientry-id455">Wages, <a class="indexterm" href="#en_US_2025_publink1000313530">Employees’ Pay</a></dt>
	<dt id="ientry-id255">Work opportunity credit, <a class="indexterm" href="#en_US_2025_publink100024020">Work opportunity credit (Form 5884).</a></dt>
</dl>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
      
  </div>
</article>

